Pennywright's Last Stand is a three story inn and bar in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]]. The inn is named after the original owner -- an orcish adventurer whose demise is memorialized in a large bronze statue outside of the building.
